# This service does not auto-load .env: export these values through systemd,
# Docker or the invoking shell. OPC UA TCP port. Default: 4840.
PORT=4840

# Real username/password for the one authenticated role this server
# defines (write access to MaintenanceMode - see src/server.ts). Both
# unset (the default) means no username/password login is possible at
# all - isValidUser rejects every credential rather than shipping a
# silent default login. Every other client stays anonymous/read-only.
# OPCUA_ADMIN_USERNAME=hydra-admin
# OPCUA_ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me
